{
    "$comment": "The request bodies and the list filter (`query`) of the __LABEL__ module. Both servers read this file, so both reject the same input with the same message. Supported keywords: type, properties, required, additionalProperties (false only), enum, minLength, maxLength, minimum, maximum, pattern (matches the whole string), format (uuid), items, maxItems, minProperties.",
    "create": {
